			"Message": "docs(Grove): Update Documentation/Rust submodule to latest\n\nUpdate the Documentation/Rust submodule from commit d80f659 to 97b559b, bringing in new documentation commits (6d4d3060, 97b559b9) to the Grove extension host component.\n\nThis keeps the embedded Rust documentation current with recent changes to the Grove codebase.",
